<title>DUBAI: Saudi Aramco lifts bunker fuel prices $3 a tonne.</title>
<headline>Saudi Aramco lifts bunker fuel prices $3 a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco said it had increased its bunker fuel prices by $3 a tonne with effect from September 26.</p>
<p>A-960 from the Gulf and the Red Sea is raised to $123 a tonne ($18.88 a barrel), while A-888 is increased to $212 a tonne.</p>
</text>
